 "segments": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 3.32,
   "t": "four early warning signs so that no one becomes a victim."
  },
  {
   "s": 4.02,
   "e": 9.78,
   "t": "Red Flag One, the childhood McDonald triad, intentional, premeditated animal cruelty"
  },
  {
   "s": 9.78,
   "e": 15.26,
   "t": "beginning at age 10. It is a primary clinical indicator of severe empathy deficits and"
  },
  {
   "s": 15.26,
   "e": 21.36,
   "t": "escalating violent conduct that families often overlook. Red Flag Two, extreme domestic"
  },
  {
   "s": 21.36,
   "e": 27.32,
   "t": "psychological abuse, confining children in dark isolated spaces and chronic verbal humiliation."
  },
  {
   "s": 27.32,
   "e": 34.38,
   "t": "Red Flag 3, immersion in violent domination fantasies severed from reality, coupled with"
  },
  {
   "s": 34.38,
   "e": 35.98,
   "t": "obsessive research into weapons."
  },
  {
   "s": 37.24,
   "e": 43.06,
   "t": "And Red Flag 4, superior intellect, paired with shallow affect, using intelligence to"
  },
  {
   "s": 43.06,
   "e": 45.62,
   "t": "manipulate adults while void of genuine remorse."
  },
  {
   "s": 47.16,
   "e": 51.86,
   "t": "Edmund Kemper was born with a genius intellect and imposing strength, but submerged in cruelty,"
  },
  {
   "s": 52.38,
   "e": 54.1,
   "t": "those gifts mutated into destruction."
  },
  {
   "s": 55.14,
   "e": 60.48,
   "t": "Locking evil behind bars is the duty of the law, but identifying and healing emotional wounds in"
  },
  {
   "s": 60.48,
   "e": 67.4,
   "t": "children is how we prevent evil. Episode 3 of Amber Eyes, watch the full dossier via the link in our bio."
  }
 ]
